      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرُرٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَارٌّ</span>. It is applied to a woman as
meaning <i>Wont to flee from that which induces
doubt,</i> or <i>suspicion,</i> or <i>evil opinion.</i> (S.) ― 
